"""Practical specialist starting tasks shared by public guides and downloads."""

FIRST_TASKS={
    'software-engineer':'Bring a failing test or bug report. Reproduce the problem, make a focused repair, and run a regression check.',
    'data-engineering-architect':'Bring a CSV or table schema. Identify duplicate keys, missing values and schema changes, then create a data-quality checklist.',
    'automation-engineer':'Describe a repeated task across your tools. Map its inputs and dependencies, choose the right connectors, and build a workflow with clear result checks.',
    'infrastructure-reliability-engineer':'Bring service metrics and an availability goal. Calculate the error budget and identify the next reliability improvement.',
    'research-evaluator':'Bring a research question and its strongest sources. Compare their methods and findings in a linked evidence table.',
    'claims-adjudicator':'Bring two competing claims and the evidence behind each. Trace the original sources and write a conclusion with the unresolved questions.',
    'adversarial-verifier':'Bring an application you own and one important user flow. Develop failure cases, test its boundaries, and turn findings into a repair checklist.',
    'reverse-engineering-researcher':'Bring an application or protocol you are authorized to inspect. Record its inputs and outputs, map its behavior, and test a reconstruction.',
    'creative-studio':'Bring a visual idea and reference material. Develop a creative brief, a shot list and an animation plan with assets, timing and delivery settings.',
    'product-interface-designer':'Bring a screen or user journey. Review its layout, labels, interaction states and accessibility, then propose a clear redesign.',
    'model-builder':'Bring a model task and a sample dataset. Define the evaluation, build a baseline and compare errors before choosing the next experiment.',
    'learning-coach':'Bring a lecture or notes. Build a connected topic outline, create flashcards and quiz yourself on the ideas that need another pass.',
    'personal-companion':'Bring today\'s commitments and unfinished tasks. Make a workable plan, capture your notes and choose the next three actions.',
    'garden-companion':'Bring your plant list and recent observations. Build a garden record and a seasonal care plan you can update as things change.',
    'coordinator':'Bring a project goal, deadline and available resources. Break the work into dependencies, assign specialist roles and prepare the first handoff.',
}
